@startuml mppdp5-robustness
title mppdp5 — Robustness Diagram (Boundary / Control / Entity)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

actor "利用者" as User
actor "カメラ" as Camera

package "Boundary / 入出力境界" {
  boundary "CameraCapture\n(OpenCV)" as Capture
  boundary "Browser UI\n(p5.js)" as Browser
  boundary "Processing Sketch\n(oscP5)" as Projection
  boundary "WebSocket Endpoint" as WSBoundary
  boundary "OSC/UDP Endpoint" as OSCBoundary
}

package "Control / 制御" {
  control "Pose Pipeline\n(server.py)" as Pipeline
  control "Pose Estimator\n(MediaPipe Pose)" as Estimator
  control "Pose Interpreter" as Interpreter
  control "WebSocket Publisher" as WSPublisher
  control "OSC Publisher" as OSCPublisher
  control "Tracking Recovery" as Recovery
}

package "Entity / ドメインデータ" {
  entity "VideoFrame\n(ephemeral)" as Frame
  entity "PoseLandmarks" as Landmarks
  entity "MotionFeatures" as Features
  entity "InteractionState" as State
  entity "CalibrationConfig" as Config
  entity "PrivacyPolicy" as Privacy
}

User --> Browser : 身体動作で操作
Camera --> Capture : video frames
Capture --> Pipeline : frame (memory only)
Pipeline --> Estimator : infer(frame)
Estimator --> Landmarks : estimate
Landmarks --> Interpreter : landmarks + confidence
Interpreter --> Features : derive speeds / sway
Interpreter --> State : classify movement
Config --> Pipeline : camera / thresholds / ports
Privacy ..> Pipeline : no raw-frame persistence\nor transmission

Pipeline --> Recovery : tracking lost?
Recovery --> State : reset / TrackingLost
Recovery --> Features : neutral values

State --> WSPublisher : semantic state
WSPublisher --> WSBoundary : JSON over WebSocket
WSBoundary --> Browser : state updates
Features --> OSCPublisher : numeric features
Landmarks --> OSCPublisher : normalized points
OSCPublisher --> OSCBoundary : OSC messages
OSCBoundary --> Projection : UDP / port 12000

note bottom of Interpreter
  One interpretation pipeline.
  Renderers must not duplicate pose
  estimation or semantic interpretation.
end note

note bottom of Recovery
  Missing landmark: (-1, -1)
  Lost tracking: reset motion values
  and publish a safe neutral/lost state.
end note

note bottom of Privacy
  Raw video is transient and local.
  Only derived numeric / semantic data
  crosses WebSocket or OSC boundaries.
end note
@enduml
